From 20eb4f4f29ee2296d1141a2036a6f8c5a6989c59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Girija P <gpandiya@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 09:31:45 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Fix powersave recovery ordering and MLD BSSID allocation

- Extend radio powersave control to WHM and order requests by topology.
- Support wired teardown powersave for local gateways without backhaul.
- Avoid reconnect watchdog handling for local gateway radios.
- Add shared MLD BSSID reservations across NL80211 AP managers.
- Release stale reservations and prevent cross-radio BSSID reuse.

Signed-off-by: Girija P <gpandiya@qti.qualcomm.com>
